{"nodes":[{"id":"node_meta_001","type":"text","x":-800,"y":-600,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"1","text":"# 📄 论文元数据\n\n**标题**: On the Trajectory Regularity of ODE-based Diffusion Sampling\n[](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=8147bee5e3c022599861eb0b&)\n**作者**: Defang Chen, Zhenyu Zhou, Jian-Ping Mei, Chunhua Shen, Chun Chen, Can Wang [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=4da19fb902c8feabf69e6afd&)\n**单位**: Zhejiang University, Zhejiang University of Technology [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=4b5c795f33aac9d71bbbbc93&)\n**代码**: https://github.com/zju-pi/diff-sampler [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=714f777a631c47c39d40b2fe&)\n**摘要**: 本文通过几何视角分析扩散模型ODE采样，揭示采样轨迹与去噪轨迹的结构，并建立与均值漂移的理论联系。"},{"id":"node_intro_motiv_01","type":"text","x":-800,"y":-200,"width":500,"height":200,"text":"## 1. 研究背景与动机\n扩散模型在图像、视频、音频、文本生成等领域取得巨大成功。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=4b6b5ccfe551489cb58d7892&)\n这类模型由随机微分方程(SDE)驱动，利用前向加噪与反向去噪过程。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=173f1b0b82a61d607dd06705&)\n基于常微分方程(ODE)的确定性采样消除了随机性，使生成过程更可控、更可解释。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=efa2afc43d97542986ba98f6&)\n**动机**：尽管数学框架密集，但扩散模型在采样时的具体行为仍未得到充分理解。本文旨在提供一种直观的几何视角来审视扩散模型尤其是其采样动力学。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=78257b90238dbc2c0ce6cb86&)"},{"id":"node_core_discovery_01","type":"text","x":-800,"y":100,"width":500,"height":300,"color":"5","text":"## 🌟 核心发现 (Core Discoveries)\n本文揭示并分析了扩散模型ODE采样中的两条关键轨迹：\n1.  **采样轨迹 (Sampling trajectory)**: 从噪声到数据分布的外显轨迹，**近乎直线(准线性)**。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=2a726ee6971a594497e44444&)\n2.  **去噪轨迹 (Denoising trajectory)**: 由去噪输出形成的隐式轨迹，**收敛速度更快**。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=fbbe4828ba88b04c7bc81f1b&)\n**关键关系**：\n- 去噪轨迹的导数与采样轨迹的**二阶导方向一致**，所有二阶采样器都可从去噪轨迹的有限差分导出。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=0d7cbec0ab3d4c293b909d1f&)\n- ODE最优采样与经典**均值漂移算法**在理论上深刻关联。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=535bcae6e68dbbaf7a48209f&)"},{"id":"node_method_ve_sde_01","type":"text","x":-300,"y":-400,"width":500,"height":200,"text":"## 2. 研究方法论：方差爆炸(VE) SDE\n本文以**方差爆炸(VE) SDE**作为主要分析框架。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=b24efb85d5955e3291475da7&)\n其参数为: $f(x, t) = 0$, $g(t) = \\sqrt{2t}$，噪声水平 $\\sigma_t = t$。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=60c822f51d7068afe4e6fe58&)\n在此设定下，**经验概率流ODE (PF-ODE)** 为：\n$$\ndx = \\frac{x - r_\\theta(x; t)}{t} dt\n$$\n其中 $r_\\theta(x; t)$ 是去噪模型。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=7b832171c01929d018898869&)\n**去噪轨迹**定义为在不同时间步上对样本去噪输出的序列 $\\{r_\\theta(\\hat{x}_t)\\}$。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=698e7b4a592098697ccac3db&)"},{"id":"node_forward_process_01","type":"text","x":-300,"y":-100,"width":500,"height":200,"text":"## 3.1 前向扩散过程：幅度与流形扩展\n前向过程不仅是平滑，更是**样本幅度与流形的扩展**。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=cadce754ce0ac530819a9985&)\n**数学机理**：给定高维向量 $x$ 和高斯噪声 $z \\sim N(0, \\sigma^2 I_d)$，随着维度增加($d \\to \\infty$)，噪声样本幅度以概率1大于原始样本幅度($P(\\|x+z\\| > \\|x\\|) \\to 1$)。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=f8cee23b67ede5642f3df5fa&)\n因此，前向过程将低维流形上的数据扩展到了半径为 $\\sigma\\sqrt{d}$ 的高维球面上，为后续生成奠定了基础。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=8031f3f120600ff52e78dec9&)"},{"id":"node_backward_process_01","type":"text","x":-300,"y":200,"width":500,"height":400,"text":"## 3.2 后向生成过程：轨迹的几何结构\n### 观察 1: 采样轨迹准直，去噪轨迹弯曲 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=ed11efa9fa2300adc6fdb420&)\n采样轨迹的线性偏差极小(比率约0.0036)，角度偏差cos值始终在0.98-1.00之间。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=082244f90c6696e7d6ad082f&)\n### 观察 2: 收敛单调性 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=ab68a29cc67d94e48e8a5630&)\n采样轨迹和去噪轨迹上的样本都单向地朝他终态点移动，类似凸函数上的梯度下降行为。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=eb9ae25029eeefa0d4ba5e53&)\n### 观察 3: 去噪轨迹收敛更快 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=6264e6d6b89f67cf441bbd2a&)\n在视觉质量、FID分数和样本似然上，去噪轨迹都领先于采样轨迹。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=af1374c46ef93773d14e82f4&)\n**应用: ODE-Jump 采样器** [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=108846f5fb349477aafeb6a4&)\n基于此观察，提出从采样轨迹向去噪轨迹\"跳跃\"的策略，能极大减少功能评估次数(NFE)并获得更好质量。"},{"id":"node_finite_diff_01","type":"text","x":300,"y":-400,"width":500,"height":250,"text":"## 4. 去噪轨迹的有限差分与二阶采样器\n**核心公式**: 去噪轨迹的ODE (Denoising-ODE)\n$$\n\\frac{dr_\\theta(x; t)}{dt} = -t \\frac{d^2x}{dt^2}\n$$\n揭示了去噪轨迹封装了采样轨迹的**曲率/凹度信息**。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=e5257a067dbcc61da07d5509&)\n基于此，可以推导出采样轨迹的二阶泰勒展开近似，而各种流行二阶采样器（如EDM Heun、DPM-Solver-2、S-PNDM、DEIS）本质上是对 $dr_\\theta/dt$ 的不同**有限差分近似**。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=96d74b25ead23ba0b9d19bf2&)"},{"id":"node_mean_shift_01","type":"text","x":300,"y":-50,"width":500,"height":280,"text":"## 5. ODE采样与均值漂移的理论联系\n**核心洞察**: ODE基础上的最优采样，每一步都等价于**退火均值漂移**和当前位置的**凸组合**。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=4015debf74e419fbb2aa1d32&)\n**理论基础**: 最优去噪输出 $r^*_\\theta(\\hat{x}; t)$ 的公式与非参数均值漂移中的均值向量 $m(x)$ 高度相似。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=0f317a082fc0604e55fea7a2&)\n**推论**: 一旦模型收敛至最优，ODE轨迹完全由**随噪声水平变化的均值漂移**决定，与模型架构或训练算法无关。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=9c46835e971a416cd2825220&)"},{"id":"node_theorem1_01","type":"text","x":300,"y":330,"width":500,"height":220,"color":"4","text":"## 定理 1: 样本似然的单调非递减性 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=7841b26d32e8e0f955543b66&)\n在温和条件下（学习到的去噪输出落在以最优去噪输出为球心、$\\|r^*_\\theta - \\hat{x}_t\\|$ 为半径的球内），**样本似然**在采样轨迹上是单调非递减的：\n- $p_h(r_\\theta(\\hat{x}_{t_n})) \\ge p_h(\\hat{x}_{t_n})$\n- $p_h(\\hat{x}_{t_{n-1}}) \\ge p_h(\\hat{x}_{t_n})$\n这为去噪轨迹优于采样轨迹的现象提供了理论保证。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=b339e261ce541c50aa878c02&)"},{"id":"node_score_dev_01","type":"text","x":800,"y":-400,"width":500,"height":250,"text":"## 6. 得分偏差的诊断\n通过比较学习得分与最优得分，发现得分偏差在不同噪声区域行为各异：\n- 在高噪声区域($10 < t \\le 80$)，偏差几乎忽略不计。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=1c813cfb02b752aee85f2bcd&)\n- 在中等噪声区域($3 < t \\le 10$)，偏差开始增加。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=33104502094dc6f6cfc3c824&)\n- 在低噪声区域($0 \\le t \\le 3$)，偏差再次下降。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=33104502094dc6f6cfc3c824&)\n**核心观点**：一定的得分偏差是保证模型**生成能力**的关键，否则采样将退化为简单的数据集复现。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=fb5162245f7fde53b5a18e9a&)"},{"id":"node_appendix_distill_01","type":"text","x":800,"y":-50,"width":500,"height":200,"color":"6","text":"## 应用与扩展：蒸馏技术与潜在插值\n- **一致性模型(CD)解读**: 基于几何视角，CD等蒸馏方法的本质是通过去噪轨迹来引导评分微调，使采样轨迹线性化。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=878f13f7635757da4eccc537&)\n- **潜在空间插值**: 揭示了线性插值在潜在空间会破坏分布，而**\"分布内插值\"(In-distribution interpolation)** 能保持潜在分布，是更优的策略。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=fb239ec2b587458a1c8b3e0c&)"},{"id":"node_conclusion_01","type":"text","x":800,"y":250,"width":500,"height":200,"color":"4","text":"## 7. 总结与展望\n本文为扩散模型，特别是其ODE采样动力学提供了一种**几何视角**。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=07e42d27858d3e02a02d8cc2&)\n数据分布与噪声分布被一条**准线性采样轨迹**和一条**收敛更快的去噪轨迹**平滑桥接。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=4708bba5eef91057f5bd3422&)\n这两条轨迹深度耦合，二阶采样器对应于去噪轨迹的有限差分。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=802706332908e94562b07630&)\n未来方向：利用控制论工具分析采样过程的稳定性等更多性质。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=b4d4f1c466a3f21f0e1d6819&)"},{"id":"node_explain_pfode","type":"text","x":-300,"y":-700,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"2","text":"💡 **概念解释：概率流ODE (PF-ODE)**\n一种确定性的常微分方程，其对应连续时间扩散过程在每一时刻的边际分布，与随机微分方程(SDE)完全相同。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=f7c1e2e47810cc3e53a40a76&)"},{"id":"node_explain_mean_shift","type":"text","x":300,"y":-700,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"2","text":"💡 **概念解释：均值漂移 (Mean Shift)**\n一种非参数模式搜索算法。通过迭代地将点移向其周围样本点的加权平均值，最终收敛到概率密度函数的局部最大值（模式）。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=4e07aea9595210edd9fa4d8b&)"},{"id":"node_explain_manifold","type":"text","x":-700,"y":-700,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"2","text":"💡 **概念解释：流形扩展**\n前向扩散过程将低秩、小幅度数据逐渐注入噪声，使其从原本的低维流形上“膨胀”到一个高维球壳上。 [](zotero://meet-awesome-gpt?iv=beb8acc887737011eaefdd01&)"},{"id":"node_explain_fid","type":"text","x":730,"y":-700,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"2","text":"💡 **概念解释：FID (Fréchet Inception Distance)**\n评估生成图像质量的常用指标。分数越低，表示生成的图像与真实图像在特征空间的距离越接近，质量越高。"}],"edges":[{"id":"edge_meta_to_intro","fromNode":"node_meta_001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node_intro_motiv_01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_intro_to_method","fromNode":"node_intro_motiv_01","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node_method_ve_sde_01","toSide":"left"},{"id":"edge_method_to_forward","fromNode":"node_method_ve_sde_01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node_forward_process_01","toSide":"top","label":"前提"},{"id":"edge_forward_to_backward","fromNode":"node_forward_process_01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node_backward_process_01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_explain_fid_to_backward","fromNode":"node_explain_fid","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node_backward_process_01","toSide":"right","label":"解释"},{"id":"edge_forward_to_core","fromNode":"node_forward_process_01","fromSide":"left","toNode":"node_core_discovery_01","toSide":"right"},{"id":"edge_backward_to_core","fromNode":"node_backward_process_01","fromSide":"left","toNode":"node_core_discovery_01","toSide":"right","label":"验证"},{"id":"edge_backward_to_finite","fromNode":"node_backward_process_01","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node_finite_diff_01","toSide":"left"},{"id":"edge_finite_to_meanshift","fromNode":"node_finite_diff_01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node_mean_shift_01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_meanshift_to_theorem","fromNode":"node_mean_shift_01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node_theorem1_01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_theorem_to_scoredev","fromNode":"node_theorem1_01","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node_score_dev_01","toSide":"left","label":"实证"},{"id":"edge_scoredev_to_appendix","fromNode":"node_score_dev_01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node_appendix_distill_01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_appendix_to_conclusion","fromNode":"node_appendix_distill_01","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node_conclusion_01","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge_core_to_conclusion","fromNode":"node_core_discovery_01","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node_conclusion_01","toSide":"left"},{"id":"edge_explain_pfode_to_method","fromNode":"node_explain_pfode","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node_method_ve_sde_01","toSide":"top","label":"解释"},{"id":"edge_explain_ms_to_meanshift","fromNode":"node_explain_mean_shift","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node_mean_shift_01","toSide":"top","label":"解释"},{"id":"edge_explain_manifold_to_forward","fromNode":"node_explain_manifold","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node_forward_process_01","toSide":"top","label":"解释"}]}